WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.151
"Preventing and Treating Varicose Veins"

00:00:07.151 --> 00:00:09.080
Blood pumps out
through the heart

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:10.620
to the body
through the arteries,

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:13.400
and then returns back
to the heart from the body

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.960
through the veins.

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:17.040
Veins contain one-way valves

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:20.120
that direct blood flow
back to our chest.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:22.840
In our legs, blood flows
from superficial veins

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:25.840
under our skin to deep veins
in our muscles,

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:28.520
and then from distal
to proximal, that is,

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:29.960
from our feet
towards our center.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:32.800
When our calves contract,

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.080
blood is squeezed up
past the knee,

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.720
then when
our thigh muscles contract

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:39.000
blood is pushed up
into our torso,

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.000
and the valves
prevent backflow.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.480
However, if the valves
in our leg veins fail,

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:47.520
blood flows down and out,

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:49.000
and veins under our skin

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.280
can become enlarged
and tortuous.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:53.200
These so-called varicose veins

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:55.400
affect as many
as 15 percent of men

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:58.400
and 29 percent of women.

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:01.200
Varicose veins are not just
a cosmetic issue.

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:04.440
They can be associated with
feelings of pain, heaviness,

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:06.000
and itchiness.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.360
Compression stockings

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:09.240
were traditionally
the standard therapy

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:12.560
for management of symptoms,
but over the last decade,

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:16.120
the lack of evidence
for compression efficacy

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:17.240
combined with the development

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:20.720
of minimally invasive
endovenous ablation techniques

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:23.400
has shifted
treatment recommendations.

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:24.600
Under local anesthesia,

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:28.000
a vascular surgeon
or interventional radiologist

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.360
makes a small incision
and under ultrasound guidance

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:34.280
threads a catheter
into the varicose vein

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:37.520
and then uses laser
or high-intensity radio waves

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:40.680
to cauterize (burn) the vein
from the inside out,

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:42.480
closing it off.

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:45.880
(The body then reroutes blood
through other veins.)

00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:48.760
There is a risk of damaging
the surrounding nerves,

00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:51.840
which happens
in about 7 percent of cases,

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:54.600
but most nerve damage
is temporary.

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:57.360
Full surgical removal
of varicose veins

00:01:57.360 --> 00:01:59.920
has fallen into disfavor,

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:01.640
but based on
a five-year follow-up

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:03.240
of a randomized trial
of treatments

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:06.760
it may still be preferable
to sclerotherapy,

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:09.000
in which a caustic
chemical liquid or foam

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:13.160
is injected straight into a vein
to scar it closed.

00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:14.640
You’ll note that
none of these treatments

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:17.560
actually treats
the underlying cause.

00:02:17.560 --> 00:02:20.040
What can we do
to prevent varicose veins

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:21.840
in the first place?

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:23.480
Risk factors
for varicose veins

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:27.520
include chronically increased
intra-abdominal pressure

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:31.040
due to obesity, pregnancy,
or chronic constipation,

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:34.440
along with being a woman,
and prolonged standing.

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:36.680
In fact, part of the reason
women are at higher risk

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:39.360
may be because they are
more likely to be in jobs

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:42.520
requiring prolonged standing.

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:44.320
(Those who do need
to stand all day

00:02:44.320 --> 00:02:45.800
can take solace
in the fact

00:02:45.800 --> 00:02:48.200
that standing more
on a regular basis

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:49.840
is associated with
a decreased risk

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:53.040
of obesity
and premature death.)

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:55.920
Another reason varicose veins
are more common in women

00:02:55.920 --> 00:03:00.040
is pregnancy, with more kids
associated with more risk.

00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:02.080
(Again, hopefully, worth it!)

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:04.560
Though obesity appears
to triple the risk,

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:08.640
that still can’t account for
the extraordinary disparity

00:03:08.640 --> 00:03:11.080
between the rates
in the industrialized world

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:15.720
versus the developing world,
particularly rural Africa.

00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:17.280
In Uganda, for example,

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:20.200
a survey found
only six individual cases

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:23.840
of varicose veins
out of 5,000 adults.

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:27.960
Perhaps Africans had more than
50 times fewer varicose veins

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:31.960
for the same reason they had
50 times less heart disease,

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:34.800
up to 50 times
less colon cancer,

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:36.840
and up to
more than 50 times less

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:38.560
of other "pressure diseases,"

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:42.840
like diverticulosis,
hiatal hernia, and hemorrhoids.

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:46.120
Because their diet was so packed
with whole plant foods,

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:48.880
rural Africans were among
the only known populations

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:52.760
ever recorded eating
the 100-plus grams of fiber

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:55.480
that is more normal
for our species

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:56.880
(based on coprolites,

00:03:56.880 --> 00:04:01.280
prehistoric "paleopoo"
fossilized feces).

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:03.360
There is an epidemic
of constipation

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:05.280
among Western seniors,

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:08.160
but bowel movements
should be effortless.

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:10.560
When we have
to strain at stool,

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:13.920
the pressure may balloon
outpouchings from our colon,

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:15.440
causing diverticulosis,

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:18.120
and force part of our stomach
up through the diaphragm

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:21.360
into our chest cavity,
causing a hiatal hernia.

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:23.960
The increased abdominal pressure
may also back up blood flow

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:26.760
in the veins around the anus,
causing hemorrhoids,

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:29.000
and push blood flow
back into the legs,

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:32.120
causing the valves in the veins
of our legs to fail,

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:34.800
resulting in varicose veins.

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:36.840
The root cause of straining

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:40.920
is the effort needed to pass
unnaturally firm stools,

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:42.960
but we can treat that cause
by eating

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:45.120
enough fiber-containing
whole plant foods

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:47.320
to create stools
so large and soft

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:51.080
that you can pass them
effortlessly.

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:52.720
Given the fiber connection,

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:54.960
it’s no surprise
that Western vegetarians

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:57.240
also have lower rates
of pressure diseases

00:04:57.240 --> 00:04:59.320
like diverticulosis,
hemorrhoids,

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:01.360
and varicose veins,

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:03.560
but that may not be
the only reason.

00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:05.240
A study of elderly vegetarians

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:06.880
found they also have
a much lower incidence

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:09.440
of varicose veins
under the tongue,

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:12.120
as well as fewer
sublingual bleeding capillaries,

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:14.480
a condition known
as caviar tongue.

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:16.160
Given the dilation of veins

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:18.280
and thinning
of blood vessel walls

00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:20.280
characteristic of scurvy,

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:21.280
the researchers suspect

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:23.320
the low rates of varicose veins
in vegetarians

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:29.480
may also have to do with
their greater vitamin C intake.

